{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/sendpurchase:withprice:currencycode:anddate:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)sendPurchase:withPrice:currencyCode:andDate:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","title":"sendPurchase:withPrice:currencyCode:andDate:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendPurchase:withPrice:currencyCode:andDate:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"sendPurchase:withPrice:currencyCode:andDate:","kind":"identifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sendPurchase:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSString","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"productIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"withPrice:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDecimalNumber","text":"NSDecimalNumber"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"price"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"currencyCode:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"currencyCode"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"andDate:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSDate","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDate"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"date","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"productIdentifier","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The product identifier (SKU)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The purchase price as NSDecimalNumber for precision."}]}],"name":"price"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"ISO 4217 currency code (e.g., “USD”, “EUR”, “GBP”).","type":"text"}]}],"name":"currencyCode"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The date when the purchase occurred."}]}],"name":"date"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Manually track a purchase when you need more control than automatic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"StoreKit tracking, or when processing purchases from other sources"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(web purchases, promotional codes, etc.)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this for:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Non-StoreKit purchases (web, third-party payment processors)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Custom price tracking (discounts, promotions)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Server-verified purchases","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cross-platform purchase sync","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","text":"Example","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Track purchases from different sources:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class PurchaseTracker {","","    func trackStoreKitPurchase(_ transaction: SKPaymentTransaction, product: SKProduct) {","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendPurchase(","            product.productIdentifier,","            withPrice: product.price,","            currencyCode: product.priceLocale.currencyCode ?? \"USD\",","            andDate: transaction.transactionDate ?? Date()","        )","","        updatePurchaseTags(productId: product.productIdentifier, price: product.price)","    }","","    func trackWebPurchase(_ purchase: WebPurchase) {","        \/\/ Track purchase made through web checkout","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendPurchase(","            purchase.productId,","            withPrice: NSDecimalNumber(value: purchase.amount),","            currencyCode: purchase.currency,","            andDate: purchase.timestamp","        )","","        updatePurchaseTags(productId: purchase.productId,","                          price: NSDecimalNumber(value: purchase.amount))","    }","","    func trackPromotionalPurchase(productId: String, originalPrice: Decimal, discountedPrice: Decimal) {","        \/\/ Track discounted purchase","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendPurchase(","            productId,","            withPrice: NSDecimalNumber(decimal: discountedPrice),","            currencyCode: Locale.current.currencyCode ?? \"USD\",","            andDate: Date()","        )","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"used_promotion\": true,","            \"discount_amount\": NSDecimalNumber(decimal: originalPrice - discountedPrice)","        ])","    }","","    private func updatePurchaseTags(productId: String, price: NSDecimalNumber) {","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"total_purchases\": incrementPurchaseCount(),","            \"total_spent\": calculateTotalSpent(adding: price),","            \"customer_tier\": determineCustomerTier()","        ])","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Tracks an individual in-app purchase with custom price information.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/sendPurchase:withPrice:currency